<article class='group overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border bg-white shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-lg border-slate-200' data-meetup-token='mu_IhNGDo3_lPg'>
<div class='grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-0 md:grid-cols-[28rem_1fr]'>
<a class='ait-index-track-card__image relative block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-slate-100 md:aspect-[700/475]' href='p/ai-tinkerers-san-francisco-agent-infrastructure-night'>
<img alt='This image is a vibrant, illustrated banner advertising an event called &#39;AI Tinkerers San Francisco: Agent Infrastructure Night&#39;. It depicts a diverse group of people engaged in discussions and working on laptops in a modern, co-working space with a city skyline visible through large windows at dusk.. Text: AI TINKERERS
SAN FRANCISCO
AGENT INFRASTRUCTURE
