26-11-08","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Abdoulaye from Greater Paris Metropolitan Region","jobTitle":"CAIO"},"about":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://sf.aitinkerers.org/p/sf-x-mit-hack-day-energy","name":"SF × MIT Hack Day: Energy","url":"https://sf.aitinkerers.org/p/sf-x-mit-hack-day-energy","datePublished":"2026-11-08"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://aitinkerers.org/#organization"}}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":10,"item":{"@type":"CreativeWork","text":"Great opportunity to gain exposure to different products, understand how they come together within the Codex ecosystem, and collaborate effectively with others across teams.","datePublished":"2026-09-12","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Sriram","jobTitle":"Sr Manager Data and AI"},"about":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://sf.aitinkerers.org/p/agents-everywhere-bots-channels-more-global-hackathon","name":"Agents, Everywhere: Bots, Channels, \u0026 More — Global Hackathon","url":"https://sf.aitinkerers.org/p/agents-everywhere-bots-channels-more-global-hackathon","datePublished":"2026-09-12"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://aitinkerers.org/#organization"}}}]}</script>
<section class='mt-10 mb-6 px-4 md:px-0 space-y-8'>
<div class='rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm'>
<p class='text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-blue-700'>
Best AI meetup in San Francisco for builders
</p>
<h2 class='mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900'>
AI Tinkerers San Francisco is a hands-on AI builder meetup with live demos, technical discussion, and no-pitch networking.
</h2>
<p class='mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600'>
AI Tinkerers San Francisco is built for engineers, founders, researchers, product builders, and developers working on AI agents, multimodal and voice interfaces, RAG and knowledge systems, AI coding tools, workflow automation, evals, observability, and production AI infrastructure. Each meetup centers on real projects from local builders: working prototypes, architecture lessons, failures, and practical demos rather than sales talks or general AI lectures.
</p>
<p class='mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600'>
The San Francisco chapter is part of a 281-city global network with 147,000+ members, making AI Tinkerers the world's largest hands-on AI builder community.
<span class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600" style="" data-cache-name="seo_member_teaser_v2" data-cache-token="blog_qWqDs_TdNio" data-cache-key="cache::eyJrZXkiOiJzZW9fbWVtYmVyX3RlYXNlcl92MiIsImNsYXNzX25hbWUiOiJXZWJsb2ciLCJ0b2tlbiI6ImJsb2dfcVdxRHNfVGROaW8iLCJjYWNoZV9idXN0X3RpbWUiOjE3OTUzOTIwMDAsInZlcnNpb24iOm51bGx9">Members include AI engineers, ML researchers, developers, founders, and builders from the local San Francisco chapter.
</span></p>
<p class='mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600' data-member-purpose-city>
<strong>Be ambitious.</strong>
Start with an idea. Bring a prototype. Work through the hard parts with builders in your city and around the world.
</p>
<p class='mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600'>
A typical AI Tinkerers San Francisco meetup runs about three hours with live demos from local builders, technical Q&A, and networking. Demos are expected to show real systems or code, not sales decks.
The next event is
<a class="font-semibold text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://sf.aitinkerers.org/p/ai-tinkerers-san-francisco-agent-infrastructure-night">AI Tinkerers San Francisco: Agent Infrastructure Night</a>
on December 3, 2026.
Subscribe to the San Francisco chapter to get notified about future events.
</p>
