<span>Topics at AI Tinkerers San Francisco</span>
</h2>
<div class='mt-4 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2'>
<div class='rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4'>
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://aitinkerers.org/technologies/claude-code"><img class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 rounded-sm" alt="" src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?sz=32&amp;domain_url=claude.com" />
<span>Claude Code</span>
</a><p class='mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600'>
Anthropic&#39;s agentic coding tool: Unleash Claude&#39;s raw power directly in your terminal or IDE to turn complex, hours-long workflows into a single command.
 Recent talks: 
<a class="font-medium italic text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://sf.aitinkerers.org/talks/rsvp_OPre5EDPY9A">The Blueprint of a North Korean Attack on Open-Source (June 25, 2026)</a>, <a class="font-medium italic text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://sf.aitinkerers.org/talks/rsvp_dZETAb_xF00">Hacking The Browser For Fun ~And Profit~ (June 25, 2026)</a>
</p>
</div>
<div class='rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4'>
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://aitinkerers.org/technologies/agent-hooks"><img class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 rounded-sm" alt="" src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?sz=32&amp;domain_url=visualstudio.com" />
<span>Agent hooks</span>
</a><p class='mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600'>
Agent hooks inject deterministic code execution into probabilistic AI agent workflows to enforce security, automate quality checks, and manage context.
 Recent talks: 
<a class="font-medium italic text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://sf.aitinkerers.org/talks/rsvp_1SFW5CFN7NA">Chunk Sidecars: Inner-Loop Validation for AI Coding Agents (July 8, 2026)</a>
</p>
</div>
<div class='rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4'>
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://aitinkerers.org/technologies/ai-coding-agents"><img class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 rounded-sm" alt="" src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?sz=32&amp;domain_url=cursor.com" />
<span>AI coding agents</span>
</a><p class='mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600'>
Autonomous software engineers that navigate entire codebases to plan, execute, and debug complex features.
 Recent talks: 
<a class="font-medium italic text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://sf.aitinkerers.org/talks/rsvp_1SFW5CFN7NA">Chunk Sidecars: Inner-Loop Validation for AI Coding Agents (July 8, 2026)</a>
</p>
</div>
<div class='rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4'>
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://aitinkerers.org/technologies/amazon-ec2"><img class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 rounded-sm" alt="" src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?sz=32&amp;domain_url=amazon.com" />
<span>Amazon EC2</span>
</a><p class='mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600'>
Provision and manage resizable compute capacity (virtual servers, or &#39;instances&#39;) on the AWS cloud.
 Recent talks: 
<a class="font-medium italic text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://sf.aitinkerers.org/talks/rsvp_dZETAb_xF00">Hacking The Browser For Fun ~And Profit~ (June 25, 2026)</a>
</p>
</div>
<div class='rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4'>
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://aitinkerers.org/technologies/blaxel"><img class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 rounded-sm" alt="" src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?sz=32&amp;domain_url=blaxel.ai" />
<span>Blaxel</span>
</a><p class='mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600'>
Blaxel is a specialized cloud platform providing the serverless infrastructure and sandboxed environments required to build, deploy, and scale autonomous AI agents.
 Recent talks: 
<a class="font-medium italic text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://sf.aitinkerers.org/talks/rsvp_OPre5EDPY9A">The Blueprint of a North Korean Attack on Open-Source (June 25, 2026)</a>
</p>
</div>
<div class='rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4'>
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://aitinkerers.org/technologies/casco"><img class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 rounded-sm" alt="" src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?sz=32&amp;domain_url=casco.com" />
<span>Casco</span>
</a><p class='mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600'>
Casco delivers autonomous, agent-driven security testing for web applications, APIs, cloud infrastructure, and AI systems.
 Recent talks: 
<a class="font-medium italic text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://sf.aitinkerers.org/talks/rsvp_OPre5EDPY9A">The Blueprint of a North Korean Attack on Open-Source (June 25, 2026)</a>
</p>
</div>
<div class='rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4'>
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://aitinkerers.org/technologies/ci-cd"><img class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 rounded-sm" alt="" src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?sz=32&amp;domain_url=redhat.com" />
<span>CI/CD</span>
</a><p class='mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600'>
CI/CD (Continuous Integration/Continuous Delivery) is the automated software pipeline that moves code from commit to production, ensuring frequent, reliable releases.
 Recent talks: 
<a class="font-medium italic text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://sf.aitinkerers.org/talks/rsvp_1SFW5CFN7NA">Chunk Sidecars: Inner-Loop Validation for AI Coding Agents (July 8, 2026)</a>
</p>
</div>
<div class='rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4'>
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://aitinkerers.org/technologies/code-validation"><img class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 rounded-sm" alt="" src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?sz=32&amp;domain_url=w3.org" />
<span>Code validation</span>
</a><p class='mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600'>
Code validation is the automated process of checking source code against official syntax standards, compliance rules, and formatting guidelines to eliminate bugs before deployment.
 Recent talks: 
<a class="font-medium italic text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://sf.aitinkerers.org/talks/rsvp_1SFW5CFN7NA">Chunk Sidecars: Inner-Loop Validation for AI Coding Agents (July 8, 2026)</a>
</p>
</div>
<div class='rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4'>
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://aitinkerers.org/technologies/codex"><img class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 rounded-sm" alt="" src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?sz=32&amp;domain_url=openai.com" />
<span>Codex</span>
</a><p class='mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600'>
Codex is OpenAI&#39;s autonomous AI software engineering agent: it executes full development tasks in a sandboxed cloud environment.
 Recent talks: 
<a class="font-medium italic text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://sf.aitinkerers.org/talks/rsvp_OPre5EDPY9A">The Blueprint of a North Korean Attack on Open-Source (June 25, 2026)</a>
</p>
</div>
<div class='rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4'>
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://aitinkerers.org/technologies/deterministic-validation"><img class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 rounded-sm" alt="" src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?sz=32&amp;domain_url=github.com" />
<span>Deterministic validation</span>
</a><p class='mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600'>
Deterministic validation replaces unpredictable AI self-evaluation with rule-based compilers, static analyzers, and test suites to guarantee consistent, auditable software behavior.
 Recent talks: 
<a class="font-medium italic text-blue-700 hover:underline" href="https://sf.aitinkerers.org/talks/rsvp_1SFW5CFN7NA">Chunk Sidecars: Inner-Loop Validation for AI Coding Agents (July 8, 2026)</a>
</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
